    "text": "WPTV\nwebsite\nOsceola County, Florida\nSmall plane lands on Central Florida road, strikes vehicle\nBy Scott Sutton,\n9 hours agoOSCEOLA COUNTY, Fla. — Drivers in Central Florida had to dodge an aircraft that had to make a sudden landing on a busy road near Kissimmee on Wednesday morning. The Osceola County Sheriff's Office posted on its Facebook page that a small Cessna made an emergency landing on Orange Blossom Trail just west of Ham Brown Road.\n2",
